Vac S11 Elite, with some listings noting compatibility with Laresar models.", "Listed products specify HEPA filtration, but exact official filter part numbers and dimensions are not provided in the titles.", "Options include single filters and 5-piece value packs, all identified as compatible replacements rather than OEM parts."]', 'published') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hepa_grade, filter_shape=excluded.filter_shape, dimensions_json=excluded.dimensions_json, compatibility_warning=excluded.compatibility_warning, faqs_json=excluded.faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule=excluded.direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json=excluded.key_takeaways_json, status=excluded.status, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
