ails.", "Both OEM‑branded Levoit filters and third‑party multi‑pack replacements are offered, giving buyers OEM authenticity or value‑pack options."]', 'enriched') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hepa_grade, filter_shape=excluded.filter_shape, dimensions_json=excluded.dimensions_json, compatibility_warning=excluded.compatibility_warning, faqs_json=excluded.faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule=excluded.direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json=excluded.key_takeaways_json, status=excluded.status, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
INSERT INTO devices (brand_id, model_name, slug, category, seed_keyword, official_filter_code, hepa_grade, filter_shape, dimensions_json, compatibility_warning, faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json, status) VALUES ((SELECT id FROM brands WHERE slug = 'coway'), 'AP-1512HH/AP-1518R', 'coway-ap-1512hh-ap-1518r-replacement-filter', 'air_purifier', 'coway hepa filter ap-1512hh/ap-1518r', '3304899', 'True HEPA', NULL, NULL, 'Verify the exact Coway model sticker or part number on your unit before ordering. Some listings indicate compatibility with AP‑1512HH‑FP or AP‑1519P variants, which may differ from the AP‑1512HH/AP‑1518R.', '[{"q": "What filter part code fits the Coway AP‑1512HH/AP‑1518R?", "a": "The official filter part code is 3304899, used in both OEM and third‑party replacements."}, {"q": "Are OEM Coway filters different from third‑party replacements?", "a": "OEM filters are manufactured by Coway, while third‑party replacements are made by other brands but are compatible and often sold in multi‑pack bundles."}, {"q": "What filtration features are available for these filters?", "a": "Options include True HEPA filtration and high‑efficiency carbon pre‑filters, providing HEPA‑grade particle removal and odor reduction."}]', 'The Coway AP‑1512HH/AP‑1518R uses filter part code 3304899. Replacement filters include a True HEPA model and other high‑efficiency carbon pre‑filters. Both OEM Coway filters and third‑party multi‑pack replacements are available, offering similar performance at different price points. They are compatible with the standard filter housing and can be installed without tools.', '["Compatible with Coway AP‑1512HH/AP‑1518R using part code 3304899.", "Includes True HEPA and high‑efficiency carbon pre‑filters.", "OEM Coway filters and third‑party multi‑pack options are available."]', 'enriched') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hepa_grade, filter_shape=excluded.filter_shape, dimensions_json=excluded.dimensions_json, compatibility_warning=excluded.compatibility_warning, faqs_json=excluded.faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule=excluded.direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json=excluded.key_takeaways_json, status=excluded.status, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
