 as the compatible HEPA filter for the Winix C545, which is often associated with 5-stage purification systems.", "Available options include genuine OEM filters for specific Winix models (e.g., C535, 5300) and multi-pack third-party replacements (4-pack and 5-pack) for the C545.", "The filtration grade is explicitly listed as HEPA in the product titles, though exact physical dimensions and shape are not provided in the scraped data."]', 'enriched') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hepa_grade, filter_shape=excluded.filter_shape, dimensions_json=excluded.dimensions_json, compatibility_warning=excluded.compatibility_warning, faqs_json=excluded.faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule=excluded.direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json=excluded.key_takeaways_json, status=excluded.status, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
