ibility with Winix HR950 and HR1000 models, which share the Zero Pro series architecture, suggesting cross-compatibility for the Zero+ Pro Pet.", "Available filtration options include HEPA filters and activated carbon filters, with some third-party packs offering upgraded versions containing multiple units.", "Buyers can choose between genuine Winix OEM filters and third-party replacements, with part numbers like 117130 and 1712-0096-00 appearing in related listings."]', 'enriched') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hepa_grade, filter_shape=excluded.filter_shape, dimensions_json=excluded.dimensions_json, compatibility_warning=excluded.compatibility_warning, faqs_json=excluded.faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule=excluded.direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json=excluded.key_takeaways_json, status=excluded.status, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
