listings including a same-day supply filter change reminder."]', 'enriched') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hepa_grade, filter_shape=excluded.filter_shape, dimensions_json=excluded.dimensions_json, compatibility_warning=excluded.compatibility_warning, faqs_json=excluded.faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule=excluded.direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json=excluded.key_takeaways_json, status=excluded.status, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
INSERT INTO devices (brand_id, model_name, slug, category, seed_keyword, official_filter_code, hepa_grade, filter_shape, dimensions_json, compatibility_warning, faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json, status) VALUES ((SELECT id FROM brands WHERE slug = 'honeywell'), 'Class 1', 'honeywell-class-1-replacement-filter', 'air_purifier', 'honeywell class 1 filter', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Always verify your exact Honeywell air purifier model number and required filter part code against the manufacturer sticker before purchasing, as filter compatibility varies significantly across different series like HPA, 3000, 5000, and 50250-S.', '[{"q": "What replacement filter codes are compatible with Honeywell air purifiers?", "a": "Compatible filters mentioned across product listings include Filter R (HRF-R3, HRF-R2, HRF-R1), part number 24000, and genuine O HEPA filters depending on your specific model."}, {"q": "Are there official OEM and third-party replacement filters available?", "a": "Yes, the market offers both genuine Honeywell OEM filters (such as Genuine O filters) and third-party alternatives (such as Ontheone and Funmit compatible sets)."}, {"q": "What filter types are typically included in these replacement sets?", "a": "Available replacement sets feature HEPA filters and carbon pre-filters, offered in various quantities ranging from single packs to multi-packs."}]', 'Finding the correct replacement filter for a Honeywell air purifier depends on matching your specific model series, such as the HPA 100/200/300, 3000, 5000, or 50250-S. Available options in the market include both manufacturer-certified genuine parts and multi-pack third-party compatible HEPA and carbon pre-filter sets designed for these series.', '["Replacement filters are available in various pack sizes, including 1-packs and multi-packs like 6-packs, compatible with multiple Honeywell series.", "Listings feature HEPA filtration technology alongside carbon pre-filters for comprehensive household air cleaning maintenance.", "Buyers can choose between genuine OEM Honeywell filters and compatible third-party replacement options."]', 'enriched') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hepa_grade, filter_shape=excluded.filter_shape, dimensions_json=excluded.dimensions_json, compatibility_warning=excluded.compatibility_warning, faqs_json=excluded.faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule=excluded.direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json=excluded.key_takeaways_json, status=excluded.status, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
INSERT INTO devices (brand_id, model_name, slug, category, seed_keyword, official_filter_code, hepa_grade, filter_shape, dimensions_json, compatibility_warning, faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json, status) VALUES ((SELECT id FROM brands WHERE slug = 'honeywell'), '1 Inch', 'honeywell-1-inch-replacement-filter', 'air_purifier', 'honeywell 1 inch filter', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Verify the exact model sticker on your Honeywell 1 Inch unit, as listings reference specific series like HPA300 and HPA 100/200/300. Ensure the part number matches your device to avoid ordering incompatible filters.', '[{"q": "What is the official filter part code for the Honeywell 1 Inch air purifier?", "a": "Listings identify HRF-APP1 as a pre-filter code and R as a HEPA filter code for compatible HPA series models. Specific codes may vary by filter type."}, {"q": "Are there differences between OEM and third-party filters for this model?", "a": "OEM filters are manufactured by Honeywell, while third-party options are replacements. Third-party listings often offer multi-packs, whereas OEM listings typically specify single units."}, {"q": "What filtration features are available for the Honeywell 1 Inch?", "a": "Available options include A+ pre-filters and HEPA filters. Some listings specify 1-inch dimensions, though this may refer to water filters rather than air purifier components."}]', 'Replacement filters for the Honeywell 1 Inch air purifier include specific HEPA and pre-filter options. Listings identify compatible part codes such as HRF-APP1 for pre-filters and R for HEPA units. Both genuine Honeywell OEM components and third-party replacement packs are available. Buyers should verify their specific model variant to ensure correct fitment for the 1 Inch series.', '["Compatible filters include the HRF-APP1 pre-filter and HEPA filters designated as R for HPA series models.", "Filtration options range from A+ pre-filters to HEPA-grade replacements, with some listings specifying 1-inch dimensions for water filters.", "Purchase options include single OEM units and multi-pack third-party replacements, requiring verification of the exact model sticker."]', 'enriched') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hepa_grade, filter_shape=excluded.filter_shape, dimensions_json=excluded.dimensions_json, compatibility_warning=excluded.compatibility_warning, faqs_json=excluded.faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule=excluded.direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json=excluded.key_takeaways_json, status=excluded.status, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
