arying slightly (e.g., 15.75\"x24.75\") for third-party brands.", "Filtration grades range from MERV 8 (dust/pet control) to MERV 11 and MERV 13 (allergen reduction/control).", "Buyers can choose between Honeywell OEM 4-packs or third-party value packs (4 or 6 units) from brands like Simply and Filterbuy."]', 'enriched') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hepa_grade, filter_shape=excluded.filter_shape, dimensions_json=excluded.dimensions_json, compatibility_warning=excluded.compatibility_warning, faqs_json=excluded.faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule=excluded.direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json=excluded.key_takeaways_json, status=excluded.status, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
