Honeywell 2-packs and third-party 4-packs for cost-effective maintenance."]', 'enriched') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hepa_grade, filter_shape=excluded.filter_shape, dimensions_json=excluded.dimensions_json, compatibility_warning=excluded.compatibility_warning, faqs_json=excluded.faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule=excluded.direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json=excluded.key_takeaways_json, status=excluded.status, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
INSERT INTO devices (brand_id, model_name, slug, category, seed_keyword, official_filter_code, hepa_grade, filter_shape, dimensions_json, compatibility_warning, faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json, status) VALUES ((SELECT id FROM brands WHERE slug = 'blueair'), '411', 'blueair-411-replacement-filter', 'air_purifier', 'blueair replacement filter 411', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Verify your exact Blueair model sticker, as listings indicate compatibility with 411, 411+, and 411 Auto variants. Ensure your specific unit matches these designations before ordering to avoid fitment issues.', '[{"q": "What filter is compatible with the Blueair 411?", "a": "The Blueair 411 uses a replacement filter that is also compatible with the 411+ and 411 Auto models. Both genuine Blueair filters and third-party replacements are available for these units."}, {"q": "Is the Blue Pure filter an OEM part for the Blueair 411?", "a": "No, the Blue Pure filter is a third-party replacement. The genuine OEM option is the ''BLUEAIR Genuine 411 Series Air Purifier Replacement Filter, Everyday''."}, {"q": "What filtration features are specified for the Blueair 411 filter?", "a": "The provided product titles do not specify HEPA grades or detailed filtration features. They only identify the filter as a replacement for the 411 series, with one option labeled ''Everyday''."}]', 'The Blueair 411 air purifier utilizes a replacement filter compatible with the 411, 411+, and 411 Auto models. While specific part codes and HEPA grades are not explicitly detailed in the provided listings, both genuine Blueair filters and third-party replacements from Blue Pure are available. Buyers should verify their specific model variant to ensure correct fitment for their unit.', '["Replacement filters are compatible with Blueair 411, 411+, and 411 Auto air purifier models.", "Options include genuine Blueair ''Everyday'' filters and third-party replacements from Blue Pure.", "Specific technical specifications such as part numbers and HEPA grades are not listed in the provided titles."]', 'enriched') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hepa_grade, filter_shape=excluded.filter_shape, dimensions_json=excluded.dimensions_json, compatibility_warning=excluded.compatibility_warning, faqs_json=excluded.faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule=excluded.direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json=excluded.key_takeaways_json, status=excluded.status, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
INSERT INTO devices (brand_id, model_name, slug, category, seed_keyword, official_filter_code, hepa_grade, filter_shape, dimensions_json, compatibility_warning, faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json, status) VALUES ((SELECT id FROM brands WHERE slug = 'blueair'), 'Blue Pure 211', 'blueair-blue-pure-211-replacement-filter', 'air_purifier', 'blueair replacement filter for blue pure 211', NULL, 'H13', NULL, NULL, 'Buyers must verify their exact model sticker, as listings distinguish between the 211+, 211+ Auto, and 211i Max variants. Filters for the 211i Max may not be interchangeable with standard 211+ models without confirming specific part numbers.', '[{"q": "What is the official filter part code for the Blueair Blue Pure 211?", "a": "The provided product listings do not explicitly state an official filter part code. They identify compatibility with the 211+ and 211i Max series but do not list specific alphanumeric part numbers."}, {"q": "What is the difference between OEM and third-party filters for this model?", "a": "OEM filters are labeled as ''Genuine'' by Blueair for specific models like the 211+ Auto and 211i Max. Third-party options, such as the 2-pack for the 211+ series, are compatible replacements that may offer lower cost per unit but are not manufactured by Blueair."}, {"q": "What filtration features do these replacement filters provide?", "a": "The filters utilize a 2-stage filtration system consisting of H13 True HEPA and activated carbon. This combination is designed to capture fine particulates and reduce odors in the Blue Pure 211 series air purifiers."}]', 'The Blueair Blue Pure 211 series utilizes a 2-stage filtration system featuring H13 True HEPA and activated carbon media. While specific official part codes are not explicitly listed in the provided data, genuine OEM filters are available for the 211+ and 211i Max variants. Third-party options include 2-pack replacements compatible with the 211+ series, offering cost-effective alternatives for maintaining air quality.', '["Listings confirm compatibility with Blue Pure 211+ and 211i Max models, featuring a 2-stage H13 True HEPA and activated carbon filtration system.", "OEM genuine filters are available for specific variants like the 211+ Auto and 211i Max, ensuring exact manufacturer specifications.", "Third-party 2-pack replacements are available for the 211+ series, providing a multi-unit option for users seeking value over single-unit OEM purchases."]', 'enriched') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hepa_grade, filter_shape=excluded.filter_shape, dimensions_json=excluded.dimensions_json, compatibility_warning=excluded.compatibility_warning, faqs_json=excluded.faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule=excluded.direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json=excluded.key_takeaways_json, status=excluded.status, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
INSERT INTO devices (brand_id, model_name, slug, category, seed_keyword, official_filter_code, hepa_grade, filter_shape, dimensions_json, compatibility_warning, faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json, status) VALUES ((SELECT id FROM brands WHERE slug = 'blueair'), '203', 'blueair-203-replacement-filter', 'air_purifier', 'blueair 203 hepa filter', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Ensure your device is a Blueair Classic 200 series model, such as the 203, by checking the product sticker. Verify if your specific air quality needs require a standard particle filter or an added carbon layer.', '[{"q": "Which Blueair models are compatible with these filters?", "a": "These filters fit the Blueair Classic 200 and 300 series, specifically models 201, 203, 205, 215B, 250E, 270E, and 303."}, {"q": "Are there genuine Blueair filters available for the model 203?", "a": "Yes, genuine Blueair Classic 200 Series Particle filters are available, alongside third-party alternatives from brands like VEVA."}, {"q": "What types of filtration do these replacement filters provide?", "a": "Listings specify HEPA particle filtration for dust and some kits include activated carbon pre-filters to target smoke and odors."}]', 'The Blueair 203 air purifier uses Classic 200 Series replacement filters, specifically designed for the 200/300 series product line. Options include genuine Blueair particle filters and third-party HEPA replacements. Some kits feature additional activated carbon pre-filters to manage smoke and odors. Multi-packs are available for extended maintenance cycles.', '["Compatible with Blueair Classic 200 and 300 series models including the 203, 205, and 270E.", "Filter types include standard particle HEPA filters and kits with activated carbon pre-filters.", "Consumers can choose between genuine OEM Blueair filters or cost-effective third-party multi-pack replacements."]', 'enriched') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hepa_grade, filter_shape=excluded.filter_shape, dimensions_json=excluded.dimensions_json, compatibility_warning=excluded.compatibility_warning, faqs_json=excluded.faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule=excluded.direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json=excluded.key_takeaways_json, status=excluded.status, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
INSERT INTO devices (brand_id, model_name, slug, category, seed_keyword, official_filter_code, hepa_grade, filter_shape, dimensions_json, compatibility_warning, faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json, status) VALUES ((SELECT id FROM brands WHERE slug = 'blueair'), '211I', 'blueair-211i-replacement-filter', 'air_purifier', 'blueair 211i hepa filter', NULL, 'H13', NULL, NULL, 'Before purchasing, confirm your Blueair 211I unit’s exact model sticker or part number, as some listings reference the 211i Max variant and may not match all 211I configurations.', '[{"q": "What part code should I look for to ensure compatibility with my Blueair 211I?", "a": "Look for the replacement part number F2MAX, which is listed in several third‑party filters and is compatible with the Blueair 211i Max series."}, {"q": "How do OEM Genuine filters differ from third‑party AllergenBlock replacements?", "a": "OEM Genuine filters are manufactured by Blueair and carry the brand name, while third‑party AllergenBlock replacements are produced by other manufacturers and may not carry the Blueair logo."}, {"q": "What filtration features are available in the replacement filters for the Blueair 211I?", "a": "Replacement filters include H13 True HEPA filtration and high‑efficiency activated carbon, providing allergen and odor reduction."}]', 'Replacement filters for the Blueair 211I include OEM Genuine filters and third‑party AllergenBlock options. The H13 True HEPA grade appears in some listings, such as the F2MAX part. Both single‑piece OEM filters and multi‑pack third‑party replacements are available, offering flexibility for households today.', '["All listed filters are compatible with the Blueair 211I/211i Max series.", "The H13 True HEPA grade is present in the F2MAX replacement part.", "OEM Genuine filters and third‑party multi‑pack options are both available."]', 'enriched') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hep