 '["Listings confirm replacement filters for the Blueair T10i, a specific variant within the 3-in-1 category, but do not provide a universal part code for all 3 In 1 models.", "Filtration features mentioned include particle filtration and water mineral capture for humidification, though specific HEPA grades are not explicitly stated in the titles.", "Both OEM genuine Blueair filters and third-party multi-packs (e.g., 3 particle + 1 wick) are available, requiring careful model verification to avoid incompatibility with DH3i or other variants."]', 'enriched') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hepa_grade, filter_shape=excluded.filter_shape, dimensions_json=excluded.dimensions_json, compatibility_warning=excluded.compatibility_warning, faqs_json=excluded.faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule=excluded.direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json=excluded.key_takeaways_json, status=excluded.status, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
