rty replacements."]', 'enriched') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hepa_grade, filter_shape=excluded.filter_shape, dimensions_json=excluded.dimensions_json, compatibility_warning=excluded.compatibility_warning, faqs_json=excluded.faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule=excluded.direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json=excluded.key_takeaways_json, status=excluded.status, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
INSERT INTO devices (brand_id, model_name, slug, category, seed_keyword, official_filter_code, hepa_grade, filter_shape, dimensions_json, compatibility_warning, faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json, status) VALUES ((SELECT id FROM brands WHERE slug = 'germguardian'), 'AC5000E', 'germguardian-ac5000e-replacement-filter', 'air_purifier', 'germguardian ac5000e replacement filter', 'FLT5000', 'True HEPA', NULL, NULL, 'Verify your specific GermGuardian AC5000E model sticker before ordering, as the FLT5000 filter is also compatible with variants like the AC5000, AC5250PT, and AC5350B. Ensure the part number matches your device''s requirements to avoid fitment issues.', '[{"q": "What is the correct filter part number for the GermGuardian AC5000E?", "a": "The correct filter part number is FLT5000. This code is explicitly listed in product titles as compatible with the AC5000E model."}, {"q": "Are there differences between OEM and third-party FLT5000 filters?", "a": "OEM filters are manufactured by GermGuardian and labeled as ''Genuine'', while third-party options are often sold in multi-packs (2 or 3 units) and labeled as ''Replacement'' or ''Compatible''. Both are listed as True HEPA."}, {"q": "What filtration grade does the FLT5000 filter provide?", "a": "The FLT5000 filter is specified as ''True HEPA'' in the product listings, indicating it meets the standard for high-efficiency particulate air filtration."}]', 'The GermGuardian AC5000E utilizes the FLT5000 filter, which is specified as a True HEPA replacement. This filtration component is compatible with multiple GermGuardian models, including the AC5000 and AC5250PT. Buyers can select between single-unit OEM options and multi-pack third-party replacements, ensuring availability of the specific True HEPA grade required for optimal air purification performance in this device.', '["The official filter part code for the GermGuardian AC5000E is FLT5000, which is explicitly listed as compatible with this model.", "All identified listings specify the filter as ''True HEPA'', indicating a high-efficiency particulate air filtration standard.", "Purchase options include single-unit genuine filters and multi-pack (2 or 3 pack) third-party replacements, offering varied value propositions."]', 'enriched') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hepa_grade, filter_shape=excluded.filter_shape, dimensions_json=excluded.dimensions_json, compatibility_warning=excluded.compatibility_warning, faqs_json=excluded.faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule=excluded.direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json=excluded.key_takeaways_json, status=excluded.status, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
INSERT INTO devices (brand_id, model_name, slug, category, seed_keyword, official_filter_code, hepa_grade, filter_shape, dimensions_json, compatibility_warning, faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json, status) VALUES ((SELECT id FROM brands WHERE slug = 'germguardian'), 'AP5800W', 'germguardian-ap5800w-replacement-filter', 'air_purifier', 'germguardian ap5800w replacement filter', 'FLT5800', 'H13', NULL, NULL, 'Buyers should confirm that their unit is the GermGuardian AP5800W (or AP5800) and check the filter part number on the device sticker, as listings reference both FLT5800 and FLT58CB4 codes.', '[{"q": "What filter part code fits the GermGuardian AP5800W?", "a": "The listings show the FLT5800 (also referenced as FLT58CB4) as the compatible replacement filter."}, {"q": "Are OEM filters different from third‑party replacements?", "a": "OEM filters are manufactured by GermGuardian and carry the official branding, while third‑party filters are compatible replacements often sold in multi‑packs and may lack the GermGuardian label."}, {"q": "What filtration performance does the replacement filter provide?", "a": "The FLT5800 filter is described as H13 True HEPA with activated carbon pre‑filters, offering high‑efficiency particle capture and odor reduction."}]', 'Replacement filters for the GermGuardian AP5800W air purifier use the FLT5800 part, typically rated H13 True HEPA for high‑efficiency particle capture. Both OEM GermGuardian filters and third‑party multi‑pack alternatives are offered, providing options for original performance or cost‑effective replacements. They are compatible with the unit’s standard housing and designed for easy installation.', '["FLT5800 filter fits GermGuardian AP5800W models.", "H13 True HEPA grade with activated carbon pre‑filters is noted in listings.", "Both OEM GermGuardian filters and third‑party multi‑pack replacements are available."]', 'enriched') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hepa_grade, filter_shape=excluded.filter_shape, dimensions_json=excluded.dimensions_json, compatibility_warning=excluded.compatibility_warning, faqs_json=excluded.faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule=excluded.direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json=excluded.key_takeaways_json, status=excluded.status, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
INSERT INTO devices (brand_id, model_name, slug, category, seed_keyword, official_filter_code, hepa_grade, filter_shape, dimensions_json, compatibility_warning, faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json, status) VALUES ((SELECT id FROM brands WHERE slug = 'germguardian'), 'AC4200W', 'germguardian-ac4200w-replacement-filter', 'air_purifier', 'germguardian ac4200w replacement filter', 'FLT4200', 'HEPA', NULL, NULL, 'Always verify your specific GermGuardian air purifier model number and filter size against the physical unit sticker before purchasing. Variants like AC4200, AC4200W, and AC4250B share compatibility with Filter L (FLT4200) replacements, but confirming the correct part prevents ordering errors.', '[{"q": "What replacement filter code fits the GermGuardian AC4200W air purifier?", "a": "The GermGuardian AC4200W uses the FLT4200 filter, also known as Filter Size L."}, {"q": "Are there both OEM and third-party options available for the AC4200W?", "a": "Yes, listings include genuine GermGuardian OEM filters as well as third-party replacement options often sold in economical 2-packs."}, {"q": "What airborne pollutants do these replacement filters capture?", "a": "Based on product listings, the filters are capable of capturing dust, smoke, and pet dander, with official filters removing up to 99.97% of pollutants."}]', 'The GermGuardian AC4200W air purifier uses the Filter L or FLT4200 replacement filter, which features genuine HEPA filtration capable of capturing 99.97% of pollutants including dust, smoke, and pet dander. Both genuine OEM single filters and third-party multi-pack value replacements are widely available for home and office use.', '["The compatible replacement filter for the GermGuardian AC4200W is designated as Filter L or FLT4200.", "Listings indicate the filters are capable of capturing dust, smoke, and pet dander, with genuine options removing 99.97% of pollutants.", "Buyers can choose between genuine OEM single filters and economical 2-pack third-party replacement options."]', 'enriched') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hepa_grade, filter_shape=excluded.filter_shape, dimensions_json=excluded.dimensions_json, compatibility_warning=excluded.compatibility_warning, faqs_json=excluded.faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule=excluded.direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json=excluded.key_takeaways_json, status=excluded.status, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
