e-filters. These replacements are compatible with various AC4800 and AC4900 series models. Buyers should verify their specific unit model number to ensure correct fitment before purchasing.', '["The official filter part code is FLT4825, which is compatible with multiple GermGuardian AC4800 and AC4900 series air purifiers.", "Listings specify ''True HEPA'' filtration, with third-party packs often including additional activated carbon pre-filters for enhanced odor control.", "Consumers can choose between single OEM replacements or cost-effective third-party multi-packs (2 or 4 units) that include pre-filters."]', 'enriched') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hepa_grade, filter_shape=excluded.filter_shape, dimensions_json=excluded.dimensions_json, compatibility_warning=excluded.compatibility_warning, faqs_json=excluded.faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule=excluded.direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json=excluded.key_takeaways_json, status=excluded.status, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
