lters, as well as DuPont True HEPA OEM filters.", "Buyers can choose between single or multi-pack replacement sets from third-party manufacturers or official brand options."]', 'enriched') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hepa_grade, filter_shape=excluded.filter_shape, dimensions_json=excluded.dimensions_json, compatibility_warning=excluded.compatibility_warning, faqs_json=excluded.faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule=excluded.direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json=excluded.key_takeaways_json, status=excluded.status, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
INSERT INTO devices (brand_id, model_name, slug, category, seed_keyword, official_filter_code, hepa_grade, filter_shape, dimensions_json, compatibility_warning, faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json, status) VALUES ((SELECT id FROM brands WHERE slug = 'trusens'), 'Z3000', 'trusens-z3000-replacement-filter', 'air_purifier', 'trusens hepa filter z3000', NULL, 'HEPA', NULL, NULL, 'Always verify your exact TruSens model number and review product compatibility notes before purchasing, as filters vary between the Z-3000 and other series like the Z-3500.', '[{"q": "What replacement filters fit the TruSens Z3000 air purifier?", "a": "The TruSens Z3000 air purifier accommodates compatible Z-3000 replacement filters, including the TruSens DuPont Standard HEPA replacement filter designed for the Large model."}, {"q": "Are there official OEM and third-party filter options available for the TruSens Z3000?", "a": "Yes, listings include official TruSens DuPont replacement filters as well as third-party compatible filters, some of which are sold in value bundles containing HEPA filters, activated carbon, and pre-filters."}, {"q": "What filter types are typically included in third-party replacement sets for the TruSens Z-3000?", "a": "Third-party replacement filter sets for the TruSens Z-3000 frequently combine a main HEPA filter with additional activated carbon filters and pre-filters."}]', 'The TruSens Z3000 air purifier uses compatible replacement filters designed for the Z-3000 model, including the TruSens DuPont Standard HEPA replacement filter. Buyers can choose between official OEM options and third-party alternatives that frequently bundle HEPA filters alongside activated carbon filters and pre-filters for comprehensive air filtration maintenance.', '["Replacement filters are specifically designated for the TruSens Z-3000 and Z-3500 air purifier models.", "Available filtration components mentioned in product listings include standard HEPA, activated carbon, and pre-filters.", "Shoppers can select between single OEM DuPont filters and multi-pack third-party compatible filter sets."]', 'enriched') ON CONFLICT(slug) DO UPDATE SET official_filter_code=excluded.official_filter_code, hepa_grade=excluded.hepa_grade, filter_shape=excluded.filter_shape, dimensions_json=excluded.dimensions_json, compatibility_warning=excluded.compatibility_warning, faqs_json=excluded.faqs_json, direct_answer_capsule=excluded.direct_answer_capsule, key_takeaways_json=excluded.key_takeaways_json, status=excluded.status, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
